%feature("docstring")  casadi::Function::fix_name(const std::string &name) "

Turn any string into a valid function name as defined by check_name.

Runs of non-alphanumeric characters become a single underscore, a leading
non-letter gets an \"a\" prepended, the empty string becomes \"unnamed\" and
a keyword gets \"1\" appended. A valid name is returned unchanged.



::

  >>> Function.fix_name(\"my func!\"), Function.fix_name(\"1f\"), Function.fix_name(\"\")
  ('my_func_', 'a1f', 'unnamed')
  >>> Function.fix_name(\"jac\"), Function.fix_name(\"ok\")
