%feature("docstring")  casadi::DaeBuilder::w() const "

Dependent variables.

Names of the variables of category ``w``, in category order. Equivalent to
``all(\"w\")``. A variable becomes dependent when it is the left-hand side
of an explicit equation ``eq(v, expr)``; the derivative variables ``der(x)``
of the states are dependent variables too.



::

  >>> dae = DaeBuilder(\"m\")
  >>> x = dae.add(\"x\")
  >>> w = dae.add(\"w\")
  >>> dae.eq(w, sin(x))
  >>> dae.eq(dae.der(x), -w)
  >>> dae.w()
  ['w', 'der(x)']
  >>> dae.wdef()
