%feature("docstring")  casadi::DaeBuilder::add(const std::string &name,
const std::string &causality, const std::string &variability, const Dict
&opts=Dict()) "

Add a new model variable.

Creates a variable with FMI 3.0 causality and variability and returns its
symbolic expression, a dense column vector with ``numel`` elements (the
product of the dimensions). The category follows from causality and
variability and may change later when equations are added:



- ``\"parameter\"``: ``\"tunable\"`` gives ``p`` (``c`` for non-floating-point types), ``\"fixed\"`` gives ``c``; other variabilities are an error
- ``\"calculatedParameter\"``: ``d``; requires ``\"fixed\"`` or ``\"tunable\"``
- ``\"input\"``: ``u``; requires ``\"continuous\"`` or ``\"discrete\"``
- ``\"output\"`` and ``\"local\"``: ``\"constant\"`` gives ``c``, ``\"discrete\"`` gives a state ``x`` with zero derivative, ``\"continuous\"`` gives ``z`` until an equation defines the variable (``w``) or its derivative (``x``); ``\"local\"`` also accepts ``\"fixed\"`` and ``\"tunable\"`` (``d``)
- ``\"independent\"``: ``t``; requires ``\"continuous\"``, at most one per model



Variables with causality ``\"output\"`` are additionally listed in ``y()``.
Unless the first variable is the independent one, a hidden variable
``\"time\"`` is created first.



Parameters:
    name: Unique variable name; reusing a name is an error
    causality: ``\"parameter\"``, ``\"calculatedParameter\"``, ``\"input\"``, ``\"output\"``, ``\"local\"`` or ``\"independent\"``
    variability: ``\"constant\"``, ``\"fixed\"``, ``\"tunable\"``, ``\"discrete\"`` or ``\"continuous\"``
    opts: Attributes (any other key is an error): ``\"dimension\"`` (list of int, ``[1]``): shape; all entries must be positive ``\"type\"`` (string, ``\"Float64\"``): FMI 3 type, e.g. ``\"Float32\"``, ``\"Int32\"``, ``\"Boolean\"``, ``\"String\"`` ``\"start\"`` (double or list): start value, scalar is broadcast; also sets the current value, see ``get`` ``\"min\"``, ``\"max\"``, ``\"nominal\"`` (double): bounds and scaling ``\"initial\"`` (string): ``\"exact\"``, ``\"approx\"``, ``\"calculated\"`` or ``\"na\"``; default per FMI from causality and variability ``\"description\"``, ``\"unit\"``, ``\"display_unit\"`` (string): meta data
        ``\"dimension\"`` (list of int, ``[1]``): shape; all entries must be positive
        ``\"type\"`` (string, ``\"Float64\"``): FMI 3 type, e.g. ``\"Float32\"``, ``\"Int32\"``, ``\"Boolean\"``, ``\"String\"``
        ``\"start\"`` (double or list): start value, scalar is broadcast; also sets the current value, see ``get``
        ``\"min\"``, ``\"max\"``, ``\"nominal\"`` (double): bounds and scaling
        ``\"initial\"`` (string): ``\"exact\"``, ``\"approx\"``, ``\"calculated\"`` or ``\"na\"``; default per FMI from causality and variability
        ``\"description\"``, ``\"unit\"``, ``\"display_unit\"`` (string): meta data



Returns:
    Symbolic expression of the new variable, named like the variable



::

  >>> dae = DaeBuilder(\"m\")
  >>> x = dae.add(\"x\")
  >>> x, x.shape, dae.category(\"x\"), dae.causality(\"x\"), dae.variability(\"x\")
  (MX(x), (1, 1), 'z', 'local', 'continuous')
  >>> p = dae.add(\"p\", \"parameter\", \"tunable\")
  >>> dae.category(\"p\"), dae.variability(\"p\")
  ('p', 'tunable')
  >>> b = dae.add(\"b\", \"input\", dict(type=\"Boolean\", start=False))
  >>> dae.category(\"b\"), dae.variability(\"b\"), dae.type(\"b\")
  ('u', 'discrete', 'Boolean')
  >>> r = dae.add(\"r\", dict(dimension=[3], start=[1, 2, 3], min=0, unit=\"m\"))
  >>> r.shape, dae.start(\"r\"), dae.min(\"r\"), dae.unit(\"r\")
  ((3, 1), [1.0, 2.0, 3.0], 0.0, 'm')
  >>> try:
  ...   dae.add(\"x\")
  ... except Exception as e:
  ...   print(\"already exists\" in str(e))
  True
  >>> try:
  ...   dae.add(\"q\", \"parameter\", \"continuous\")
  ... except Exception as e:
  ...   print(\"requires 'fixed' or 'tunable'\" in str(e))
  True
  





See also: eq, der, var, category, set_category

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_2kp

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/dae_builder.hpp#L924
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/dae_builder.cpp#L341-L350
";

