%feature("docstring")  casadi::DaeBuilder::tear() "

Identify iteration variables and residual equations using naming convention.

Variables named ``res__<iv>`` are interpreted as residual equations with
iteration variable ``<iv>`` (optionally followed by ``__<hold>`` markers).
The iteration variables are removed from ``z`` and ``u`` and appended to
