%feature("docstring")  casadi::DaeBuilder::categories(const std::string
&name) const "

Which categories are possible for a variable?

The categories ``set_category`` accepts for the variable given its current
category and usage; an empty string stands for \"no category\". Controls,
parameters and constants can be exchanged freely; states not used in any
right-hand side can become quadrature states or lose their category.



::

  >>> dae = DaeBuilder(\"m\")
  >>> u = dae.add(\"u\", \"input\")
  >>> x = dae.add(\"x\")
  >>> q = dae.add(\"q\")
  >>> dae.eq(dae.der(x), -x)
  >>> dae.eq(dae.der(q), x**2)
  >>> dae.categories(\"u\"), dae.categories(\"x\"), dae.categories(\"q\")
  (['p', 'u', 'c'], ['x'], ['x', 'q', ''])
  





