%feature("docstring")  casadi::DaeBuilder::set_category(const std::string
&name, const std::string &val) "

Set the variable category, if permitted.

The following changes are permitted:



- Controls ``u`` can be changed to/from tunable parameters ``p`` or fixed parameters ``c``
- Differential states that do not appear in the right-hand-sides can be changed between regular states ``x``, quadrature states ``q`` and no category (empty string)
- A state can be made the independent variable ``t``, replacing the current one



Other changes are not permitted. Causality and variability is updated
accordingly.



::

  >>> dae = DaeBuilder(\"m\")
  >>> u = dae.add(\"u\", \"input\")
  >>> x = dae.add(\"x\")
  >>> q = dae.add(\"q\")
  >>> dae.eq(dae.der(x), -x)
  >>> dae.eq(dae.der(q), x**2)
  >>> dae.set_category(\"q\", \"q\")
  >>> dae.x(), dae.q()
  (['x'], ['q'])
  >>> dae.set_category(\"q\", \"\")
  >>> dae.x(), dae.q(), dae.category(\"q\")
  (['x'], [], '')
  >>> dae.set_category(\"u\", \"p\")
  >>> dae.u(), dae.p(), dae.causality(\"u\"), dae.variability(\"u\")
  ([], ['u'], 'parameter', 'tunable')
  >>> try:
  ...   dae.set_category(\"x\", \"q\")
  ... except Exception as e:
  ...   print(\"Cannot change category of x from 'x' to 'q'\" in str(e))
  True
  





See also: category, categories, set_all

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_2c4

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/dae_builder.hpp#L2777
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/dae_builder.cpp#L646-L653
";

