%feature("docstring")  casadi::Function::wrap() const "

Wrap in an MXFunction whose graph is a single call to this function.

The wrapper has the same signature and names, carries over the derivative
options (ad_weight, ad_weight_sp, max_num_dir, is_diff_in/out,
derivative_of) and is cached by name. Classes without their own derivative
or slice implementation use it internally; it is also a way to give any
function a plain MX graph.



