%feature("docstring")  casadi::Function::generate(const std::string &fname,
const Dict &opts=Dict()) const "

Generate self-contained C code for the function.

Writes ``fname`` (a \".c\" suffix is added when missing; the base name must
satisfy check_name) in the current directory and returns the file name. The
generated file exports, for a function named f, the evaluation routine int
f(const casadi_real** arg, casadi_real** res, casadi_int* iw, casadi_real*
w, int mem) plus f_n_in, f_n_out, f_name_in, f_name_out, f_sparsity_in,
f_sparsity_out, f_work, f_checkout, f_release, f_incref, f_decref and
f_default_in. The arrays hold the nonzeros of each input and output in
column-major order; work vector sizes come from f_work. Functions embedded
in the graph (solvers, maps, ...) are generated too when they support code
generation; otherwise an error is raised. The same file can hold several
functions via the CodeGenerator class.



Parameters:
    fname: File name, e.g. \"f.c\" or \"f\"
    opts: Code generator options: \"with_header\" (also write a.h file), \"main\" (add a main() reading inputs from a file written by generate_in), \"casadi_real\" (scalar type, default \"double\"), \"casadi_int\" (integer type), \"with_mem\" (simplified memory API), \"mex\", \"cpp\", \"indent\", \"prefix\", \"verbose\", \"with_export\", \"with_import\", \"include_math\", \"infinity\", \"nan\", \"real_min\", \"unroll_args\", \"codegen_scalars\", \"avoid_stack\", \"thread_safe\", \"force_canonical\"



::

  >>> import os
  >>> x = SX.sym(\"x\"); y = SX.sym(\"y\", 2)
  >>> f = Function(\"f\", [x, y], [x*y, sin(x)], [\"x\", \"y\"], [\"r\", \"s\"])
  >>> fname = f.generate(\"f.c\")
  >>> fname, os.path.isfile(\"f.c\")
  ('f.c', True)
  >>> src = open(\"f.c\").read()
  >>> print(\"int f(const casadi_real** arg, casadi_real** res\" in src, \"f_n_in\" in src)
  True True
  >>> os.remove(\"f.c\")
  >>> f.generate(\"g\", {\"with_header\": True}), sorted(os.listdir(\".\")).count(\"g.h\")
  ('g.c', 1)
  >>> os.remove(\"g.c\"); os.remove(\"g.h\")
  





See also: CodeGenerator, generate_in, generate_out, jit, external

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1wu

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/function.hpp#L2487
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/function.cpp#L1390-L1394
";

