%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericExpressionCommon::minus(const ExType
&x, const ExType &y) "

Subtraction: (x,y) -> x - y.

Elementwise difference; shape and sparsity rules as for plus. For symbolic
arguments, x - x with the same node simplifies to 0.



::

  >>> minus(DM([5, 6]), DM([1, 2]))
  DM([4, 4])
  >>> DM.eye(2) - 1
  DM(
  [[0, -1],
   [-1, 0]])
  >>> x = SX.sym(\"x\")
  >>> x - x
  SX(0)
  



Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_oo

