Elementwise; the result is dense with -inf at structural zeros. Negative
arguments give NaN; no error is raised.



::

  >>> log(DM([1, 0]))
  DM([0, -inf])
  >>> log(SX.sym(\"x\"))
  SX(log(x))
  





See also: exp, log10, log1p

