%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericExpressionCommon::log10(const ExType
&x) "

Base-10 logarithm: x -> log10(x)

Computed as log(x) * (1 / log(10)); there is no dedicated operation, which
is visible in symbolic expressions. Dense result like log.



::

  >>> log10(DM([1, 10, 1000]))
  DM([0, 1, 3])
  >>> log10(SX.sym(\"x\"))
  SX((0.434294*log(x)))
  





See also: log

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_ph

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_expression.hpp#L1164
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_expression.hpp#L1164-L1166
";

