%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericExpressionCommon::floor(const ExType
&x) "

Round down to nearest integer: x -> floor(x)

Elementwise, towards minus infinity; sparsity preserved. The derivative is
zero everywhere. Floor division x // y in Python is floor(x / y).



::

  >>> floor(DM([-1.5, 1.5]))
  DM([-2, 1])
  >>> DM([7, -7]) // 2
  DM([3, -4])
  >>> SX.sym(\"x\") // 2
  SX(floor((x/2)))
  





See also: ceil, sign

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_pk

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_expression.hpp#L1257
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_expression.hpp#L1257-L1259
";

