%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericMatrixCommon::skew(const MatType &a) "

Generate a skew symmetric matrix from a 3-vector.

skew(a) is the 3-by-3 matrix S with S*b == cross(a, b).



::

  >>> skew(DM([1, 2, 3]))
  DM(
