%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericMatrixCommon::soc(const MatType &x,
const MatType &y) "

Construct second-order-cone matrix.

soc(x, y) computes the (n+1)-by-(n+1) matrix [y*eye(n) x; x' y]. This matrix
is positive semidefinite if and only if norm_2(x) <= y, which makes it a way
to express a second-order cone constraint as a semidefinite constraint.



Parameters:
    x: Vector expression of size n (row or column; sparse entries are densified)
    y: Scalar expression



::

  >>> soc(DM([1, 2]), 3)
  DM(
  [[3, 00, 1],
   [00, 3, 2],
   [1, 2, 3]])
  





See also: norm_2

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1bj

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L687
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L687-L689
";

