%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericMatrixCommon::norm_fro(const MatType
&x) "

Frobenius norm.

sqrt(sum_ij x_ij^2) over all entries, for a matrix of any shape. Not
differentiable at x == 0 (the derivative evaluates to nan there); use sumsqr
in objectives where possible.



::

  >>> norm_fro(DM([[1, -2], [3, 4]]))
  DM(5.47723)
  >>> norm_fro(SX.sym(\"x\", 2))
  SX(sqrt((sq(x_0)+sq(x_1))))
  





See also: norm_2, norm_1, norm_inf, sumsqr

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1c4

