%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericMatrixCommon::unite(const MatType &A,
const MatType &B) "

Unite two matrices with non-overlapping sparsity patterns.

The result has the union of both patterns with the nonzeros of ``A`` and
``B`` at their positions. Both must have the same shape; a shared structural
nonzero raises \"Pattern intersection not empty\".



::

  >>> A = DM(Sparsity.upper(2), [1, 2, 3])
  >>> B = DM(Sparsity.triplet(2, 2, [1], [0]), [4])
  >>> unite(A, B)
  DM(
  [[1, 2],
   [4, 3]])
  >>> try: unite(DM.eye(2), DM.eye(2))
  ... except Exception as e: print(\"error\")
  error
  





See also: project, Sparsity::unite

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1ce

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L1713
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L1713-L1715
";

