%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericMatrixCommon::densify(const MatType
&x) "

Make the matrix dense if not already.

Structural zeros become stored numerical zeros; the shape and the values of
the existing nonzeros are unchanged. A dense input is returned as is.



::

  >>> densify(DM.eye(2))
  DM(
  [[1, 0],
   [0, 1]])
  >>> densify(SX.sym(\"x\", Sparsity.diag(2)))
  SX(@1=0,
  [[x_0, @1],
   [@1, x_1]])
  >>> densify(MX.sym(\"x\", Sparsity.diag(2)))
  MX(dense(x))
  





See also: project, sparsify, is_dense

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1cf

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L1750
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L1750-L1752
";

