%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericMatrixCommon::cse(const MatType &e) "

Common subexpression elimination.

Returns an equivalent expression in which identical subexpressions that were
built separately share a single node, reducing the number of nodes and the
evaluation cost. The shape is preserved. DM is returned unchanged.



::

  >>> x = SX.sym(\"x\"); y = SX.sym(\"y\")
  >>> e = sin(x + y)*cos(x + y)
  >>> cse(e)
  SX(@1=(x+y), (sin(@1)*cos(@1)))
  >>> n_nodes(e), n_nodes(cse(e))
  (7, 6)
  





See also: n_nodes, shared, extract

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1co

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L2150
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L2150-L2152
