%feature("docstring")  casadi::Matrix< double >::ramp(const Matrix< double >
&x) "

Ramp function, elementwise.

x for x > 0 and 0 for x <= 0, computed as x*heaviside(x). Also called the
slope function or relu. Not defined for MX; use fmax(x, 0) for an MX-
compatible alternative.



::

  >>> ramp(DM([0, 0.5, 3]))
  DM([0, 0.5, 3])
  >>> ramp(SX.sym(\"x\"))
  SX((x*((1+sign(x))/2)))
  





See also: heaviside, fmax

