";

%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericMatrixCommon::ones(casadi_int nrow=1,
casadi_int ncol=1) "

Create a dense matrix or a matrix with specified sparsity with all entries
one.

ones(sp) sets every structural nonzero of ``sp`` to one; other entries stay
structurally zero.



::

  >>> DM.ones(2, 3)
  DM(
  [[1, 1, 1],
   [1, 1, 1]])
  >>> DM.ones(Sparsity.diag(2))
  DM(
  [[1, 00],
   [00, 1]])
  





See also: zeros, Sparsity

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1di

