%feature("docstring")  casadi::Matrix< double >::is_smooth() const "

Check whether an SX expression contains only smooth operations.

False when any node is a non-smooth operation such as floor, ceil, sign, a
comparison or if_else. Operations such as fabs, fmin and fmax count as
smooth. Always true for DM.



::

  >>> x = SX.sym(\"x\")
  >>> sin(x).is_smooth(), fabs(x).is_smooth(), floor(x).is_smooth()
  (True, True, False)
  >>> if_else(x > 0, x, 0).is_smooth(), (x > 0).is_smooth(), DM(1).is_smooth()
  (False, False, True)
  



Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_19o

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/matrix_decl.hpp#L2745
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/sx_instantiator.cpp#L118-L125
";

