%feature("docstring")  casadi::Matrix< double >::get_nonzeros() const "

Get all structural nonzeros as a flat list in column-major order (Python:
nonzeros())

Implementation of Matrix::get_nonzeros (in public API)

Returns floats for DM and 1-by-1 SX objects for SX. Structural zeros are
skipped.



::

  >>> DM([[1, 2], [3, 4]]).nonzeros()
  [1.0, 3.0, 2.0, 4.0]
  >>> DM(Sparsity.diag(2)).nonzeros(), DM(2, 0).nonzeros()
  ([1.0, 1.0], [])
  >>> SX.sym(\"x\", 2).nonzeros()
  [SX(x_0), SX(x_1)]
  





See also: elements, get_nz

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1a2

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/matrix_decl.hpp#L2999
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/matrix_decl.hpp#L3438-L3443
";

