%feature("docstring")  casadi::Matrix< double >::dep(casadi_int ch=0) const
"

Get operand ch of a 1-by-1 SX expression.

Only defined for a scalar SX that is the result of an operation; a symbol, a
constant or a DM raises an error.



Parameters:
    ch: Operand index, 0 or 1



::

  >>> x = SX.sym(\"x\"); y = SX.sym(\"y\")
  >>> e = x * y
  >>> e.dep(0), e.dep(1), e.n_dep()
  (SX(x), SX(y), 2)
  





See also: n_dep, op

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1a9

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/matrix_decl.hpp#L3119
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/sx_instantiator.cpp#L225-L227
";

