%feature("docstring")  casadi::MX::evalf(const MX &expr) "

Evaluate an expression without free symbols numerically.

Builds a Function without inputs around ``expr`` and evaluates it. Function
calls, solver calls and sparse constants are handled. An error is raised
when the expression depends on a symbolic primitive.



::

  >>> evalf(MX(DM([[1, 2], [3, 4]])) @ MX([1, 1]))
  DM([3, 7])
  >>> evalf(MX(Sparsity.lower(2)) * 2)
