%feature("docstring")  casadi::MX::stop_diff(const MX &expr, const MX &var,
casadi_int order) "

Stop derivatives of an expression wrt a selected set of symbolic variables.

Like stop_diff(expr, order), but only the derivatives with respect to the
symbols occurring in ``var`` are stopped; derivatives with respect to the
other symbols are propagated. Emits a warning that this variant is not well
tested.



::

  >>> x = MX.sym(\"x\")
  >>> y = MX.sym(\"y\")
  >>> e = stop_diff(x * y, x, 1)
  >>> jacobian(e, x).nnz(), Function(\"f\", [x, y], [jacobian(e, y)])(2, 3)
