%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericMatrixCommon::rank1(const MX &A, const
MX &alpha, const MX &x, const MX &y) "

Make a rank-1 update to a matrix A.

Calculates A + alpha * x*y'



Parameters:
    alpha: Scalar; if it is a structural zero, ``A`` is returned unchanged
    x: Vector with x.numel() == A.size1() (row vectors are transposed)
    y: Vector with y.numel() == A.size2()



::

  >>> A = DM([[1, 2], [3, 4]])
  >>> rank1(A, 2, DM([1, 0]), DM([0, 1]))
  DM(
  [[1, 4],
   [3, 4]])
  >>> rank1(MX.sym(\"A\", 2, 2), MX.sym(\"a\"), MX.sym(\"x\", 2), MX.sym(\"y\", 2))
  MX(rank1(A, a, x, y))
  





See also: bilin, mtimes

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1bp

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_matrix.hpp#L919
";

