%feature("docstring")  casadi::MX::get_free(const Function &f) "

Get the free variables of a Function.

Same as f.free_mx(): the symbolic primitives that occur in the outputs of an
MXFunction without being an input. Such a Function can only be created with
the option \"allow_free\" and cannot be evaluated until the free variables
are bound.



::

  >>> x = MX.sym(\"x\")
  >>> y = MX.sym(\"y\")
  >>> f = Function(\"f\", [x], [x + y], {\"allow_free\": True})
  >>> MX.get_free(f), MX.get_free(Function(\"g\", [x], [x]))
  ([MX(y)], [])
  >>> try:
  ...   Function(\"f\", [x], [x + y])
  ... except Exception as e:
  ...   print(\"variables [y] are free\" in str(e))
  True
  





