&rr, const std::vector< casadi_int > &cc, bool ind1=false) "

Erase a submatrix (leaving structural zeros in its place)

Removes the nonzeros at the intersection of rows ``rr`` and columns ``cc``
from the sparsity pattern. The shape is unchanged. Modifies the expression
in place by replacing it with a new node that references the remaining
nonzeros.



