Number of outputs of this node.

Greater than one only for multiple-output nodes, i.e. a call to a Function
with several outputs. Every other node, including the OutputNode that
selects one output of such a call, reports 1.



::

  >>> a = SX.sym(\"a\")
  >>> f = Function(\"f\", [a], [a + 1, 2*a])
  >>> x = MX.sym(\"x\")
  >>> r0, r1 = f(x, )
  >>> call = r0.dep(0)
  >>> call, call.n_out(), r0.n_out()
