%feature("docstring")  casadi::MX::get_output(casadi_int oind) const "

Get an output of a multiple-output node.

For a multiple-output node (a Function call), returns the OutputNode
selecting output ``oind``. For any other node only ``oind`` == 0 is valid
and the node itself is returned.



::

  >>> a = SX.sym(\"a\")
  >>> f = Function(\"f\", [a], [a + 1, 2*a])
  >>> x = MX.sym(\"x\")
  >>> r0, r1 = f(x, )
  >>> call = r0.dep(0)
  >>> call.get_output(1), is_equal(call.get_output(0), r0)
  (MX(f(x){1}), True)
  >>> x.get_output(0)
  MX(x)
  





