%feature("docstring")  casadi::Opti::set_linear_scale(const MX &x, const DM
&scale, const DM &offset=0) "

Set the linear scaling of a decision variable.

The solver works with (x-offset)/scale instead of x; all user-facing values
(value(), initial guesses, duals) stay in the original units. Useful when
