%feature("docstring")  casadi::Opti::value_variables() const "

Get assignment expressions for the latest values.

value_variables() gives value==var for every variable with its latest solver
result; value_parameters() gives value==par for every parameter with its set
value. Both feed set_initial()/set_value() to transfer a solution to the
