%feature("docstring")  casadi::OptiAdvanced::bake() "

Fix the structure of the optimization problem.

Flattens the active variables, parameters and constraints into the x, p, g,
lbg and ubg vectors and builds the bounds function. Called automatically by
solve() and the accessors; raises an error when neither an objective nor a
constraint is set.

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_2nc

Doc source:
