  >>> opti.solver(\"ipopt\", {\"print_time\": False},
  ...             {\"print_level\": 0, \"max_iter\": 2, \"sb\": \"yes\"})
  >>> sol = opti.solve_limited()
  >>> sol.stats()[\"unified_return_status\"], round(sol.value(x), 2)
  ('SOLVER_RET_LIMITED', 0.36)
  



Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_1e

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/optistack.hpp#L857
