%feature("docstring")  casadi::Sparsity::sparsity_cast_mod(const Sparsity
&X, const Sparsity &Y) const "

Propagate a subset of a pattern through a sparsity cast.

``X`` and ``Y`` have the same number of nonzeros and sparsity_cast(X, Y)
maps nonzero k of X to nonzero k of Y. Given that this pattern is a subset
of ``X``, the result is the subset of ``Y`` made of the nonzeros of ``Y``
whose counterpart in ``X`` is in this pattern.



::

  >>> X = Sparsity.diag(4)
  >>> Y = Sparsity.dense(2, 2)
  >>> x = Sparsity.nonzeros(4, 4, [0, 10, 15])
  >>> DM(x.sparsity_cast_mod(X, Y), 1)
  DM(
  [[1, 1],
   [00, 1]])
  





See also: sparsity_cast, is_subset

