";

%feature("docstring")  casadi::Sparsity::banded(casadi_int n, casadi_int p)
"

Create a banded square sparsity pattern.

Union of band(n, k) for all k in [-p, p]: banded(n, 0) equals diag(n) and
banded(n, 1) is tridiagonal.



