%feature("docstring")  casadi::SparsityInterfaceCommon::sum1(const MatType
&x) "

Sum the elements of every column.

Returns a row vector with the sum over the rows, as MATLAB sum(x, 1);
implemented as the product ones(1, size1) * x, so it is a mtimes node for
MX. A column of structural zeros sums to a structural zero. For Sparsity
only the pattern is computed.



::

  >>> sum1(DM([[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]]))
  DM([[5, 7, 9]])
  >>> sum1(SX.sym(\"x\", 2, 2))
  SX([[(x_0+x_1), (x_2+x_3)]])
  >>> sum1(MX.sym(\"x\", 2, 3))
  MX(mac(ones(1x2),x,zeros(1x3)))
  >>> sum1(DM(0, 3))
  DM([[00, 00, 00]])
  





See also: sum2, sum

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_4p

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/sparsity_interface.hpp#L1669
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/sparsity_interface.hpp#L1669-L1669
";

