%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericExpressionCommon::minus(const SXElem
&x, const SXElem &y) "

Subtraction: (x,y) -> x - y.

Elementwise difference; shape and sparsity rules as for plus. For symbolic
arguments, x - x with the same node simplifies to 0.



::

  >>> minus(DM([5, 6]), DM([1, 2]))
