%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericExpressionCommon::sin(const SXElem &x)
"

Sine: x -> sin(x)

Elementwise; sparsity preserved (sin(0) == 0).



::

  >>> sin(DM.eye(2))
  DM(
  [[0.841471, 00],
   [00, 0.841471]])
  >>> sin(MX.sym(\"x\", 2))
  MX(sin(x))
  





See also: cos, tan, asin

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_p3

