%feature("docstring")  casadi::GenericExpressionCommon::cos(const SXElem &x)
"

Cosine: x -> cos(x)

Elementwise; structural zeros become 1, so the result is dense.



::

  >>> cos(DM.eye(2))
  DM(
  [[0.540302, 1],
   [1, 0.540302]])
  >>> cos(SX.sym(\"s\", Sparsity.diag(2)))
  SX(@1=1,
  [[cos(s_0), @1],
   [@1, cos(s_1)]])
  





See also: sin, tan, acos

Extra doc: https://github.com/casadi/casadi/wiki/L_p4

Doc source:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_expression.hpp#L808
Implementation:
https://github.com/casadi/casadi/blob/main/casadi/core/generic_expression.hpp#L808-L810
";

