%feature("docstring") casadi::ThreadLocalStorage "

Thread-local storage wrapper that avoids destructor calls.

Works around MinGW-w64 bug where thread_local destructors may run after
static object destructors, causing crashes at DLL unload. The wrapped object
is placement-new'd into aligned storage and never destructed. Memory is
reclaimed when thread exits.

";


