|                  |                 | there is an      |                  |
|                  |                 | option of either |                  |
|                  |                 | using forward or |                  |
|                  |                 | reverse mode     |                  |
|                  |                 | directional      |                  |
|                  |                 | derivatives, the |                  |
|                  |                 | condition ad_wei |                  |
|                  |                 | ght*nf<=(1-      |                  |
|                  |                 | ad_weight)*na is |                  |
|                  |                 | used where nf    |                  |
|                  |                 | and na are       |                  |
|                  |                 | estimates of the |                  |
|                  |                 | number of        |                  |
|                  |                 | forward/reverse  |                  |
|                  |                 | mode directional |                  |
|                  |                 | derivatives      |                  |
|                  |                 | needed. By       |                  |
