|                    |              | quadratures in the error control     |
|                    |              | [false]                              |
+--------------------+--------------+--------------------------------------+
| reltol             | OT_DOUBLE    | Relative tolerance [1e-6]            |
+--------------------+--------------+--------------------------------------+
| step0              | OT_DOUBLE    | Adaptive steps: initial step size    |
|                    |              | [default: estimated]                 |
