fatrop
------



>List of available options

+---------------------+--------------+-------------------------------------+
|         Id          |     Type     |             Description             |
+=====================+==============+=====================================+
| N                   | OT_INT       | OCP horizon                         |
+---------------------+--------------+-------------------------------------+
| convexify_margin    | OT_DOUBLE    | When using a convexification        |
|                     |              | strategy, make sure that the        |
|                     |              | smallest eigenvalue is at least     |
|                     |              | this (default: 1e-7).               |
